  "description": "Comprehensive metrics dashboard for External Proofs ExEx storage operations. Tracks block processing performance, storage operation latencies (per-item for bulk operations), and cursor performance. Use this to identify bottlenecks, optimize storage operations, and monitor overall ExEx health.",
  "editable": true,
